            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides an optical lens module (1). By assembling a first lens barrel (11), an optical folding element (13) and a second lens barrel (14), the optical lens module (1) can be miniaturized, image quality of the optical lens module (1) in a compact assembly space can be increased, and the size of a light passage opening (6311) of a display panel module (63) can be reduced so as to increase consistency of a display area (632).</p>
            </abstract>
